able GPU-to-GPU (P2P) communication by setting the environment variable NCCL_P2P_DISABLE=1, everything works as expected.\r\n\r\nWe then upgraded the OS to Ubuntu 22.04 which (apparently) solved the issue.","created_at":"2022-10-17T20:18:51Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/12701#issuecomment-1281440874","id":1281440874,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/12701","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5MYTxq","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1281440874/reactions"},"updated_at":"2022-10-17T20:18:51Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1281440874","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48100207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronbuhendwa","id":48100207,"login":"aaronbuhendwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTAwMjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"NONE","body":"This issue seems to have been fixed by the OS upgrade.","created_at":"2022-11-09T16:35:11Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/12701#issuecomment-1309028411","id":1309028411,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/12701","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5OBjA7","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1309028411/reactions"},"updated_at":"2022-11-09T16:35:11Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1309028411","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48100207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronbuhendwa","id":48100207,"login":"aaronbuhendwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTAwMjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4879686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sudhakarsingh27","id":4879686,"login":"sudhakarsingh27","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4Nzk2ODY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4879686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sudhakarsingh27","id":4879686,"login":"sudhakarsingh27","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4Nzk2ODY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudhakarsingh27","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\r\n\r\nHi,\r\n\r\nwe are facing strange behavior when using collective ops. Whenever a pmapped function includes jax.lax.all_gather or jax.lax.ppermute, the compilation of said function will stall indefinitely at 100% GPU utilization. However, the collective ops jax.lax.psum, jax.lax.pmean, jax.lax.pmin, jax.lax.pmax work fine.\r\n\r\nSetup of the server/versions of the software:\r\n-     Ubuntu 20.04\r\n-     Nvidia Driver Version 515.65.01\r\n-     CUDA Version: 11.7\r\n-     8x NVIDIA A6000\r\n-     jax 0.3.21, jaxlib 0.3.20\r\n\r\nWe tried installing jax/jaxlib both using the pip installation and building it from source. In the latter case, we manually install NCCL 2.13.4 before building jax/jaxlib from source. Both approaches yield the same outcome. We got the idea to build jax/jaxlib from source after reading the threads about similar issues https://github.com/google/jax/issues/10969, https://github.com/google/jax/issues/11637. Also, using different CUDA versions did not help. \r\n\r\nE.g., this simple code snippet will produce a deadlock.\r\n\r\nimport os\r\nimport jax\r\nimport numpy as np\r\nos.environ[\"CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES\"] = \"0,1\"\r\nx = np.arange(2)\r\ny = jax.pmap(lambda x: jax.lax.all_gather(x, axis_name='i'), axis_name='i')(x)\r\n\r\n\r\nHowever, this code snippet works just fine:\r\nx = np.arange(2)\r\ny = jax.pmap(lambda x: jax.lax.pmin(x, axis_name='i'), axis_name='i')(x)\r\n","closed_at":"2022-11-09T16:35:11Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48100207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronbuhendwa","id":48100207,"login":"aaronbuhendwa","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTAwMjA3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronbuhendwa/subs